ollowing that overlap:\n1. contrast\n2. saturate\n\nAnd to note is \"greyscale\" vs \"grayscale\", so no overlap there but ambiguous nonetheless.\n\nReferences:\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en/docs/CSS/filter#contrast(amount)\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en/docs/CSS/filter#saturate(amount)\n\nFor now I'm getting around it like so:\n\n```\n-webkit-filter: ~\"saturate(5%)\";\n```\n\nApologies if this is a known issue/wontfix.\n","closed_by":{"login":"lukeapage","id":309321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage","html_url":"https://github.com/lukeapage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/1299/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}